{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this indie horror game, a small innocent vacation turns into a living nightmare as a brewing blizzard approaches the mountain. Explore the seemingly normal cabins, abandoned mines, caves and more as you avoid and fight moss creatures that came straight from the Skull lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted by undead monsters and mutants  all made from a strange material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS horror game with a PSX style, you can make your own choices that changes the story of the game. Each decision you make will affect the outcome of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/0553dd75d465e3edbc51b1bb07ef2e14.avif?t=1764529065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras_big/0553dd75d465e3edbc51b1bb07ef2e14.avif?t=1764529065 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fate</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can have a drastic influence on the story of the game and sometimes may even be... fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Danger</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangers in these mountains can be <strong>deadly</strong> and unpredictable id you don't pay attention to your surroundings. You can never be sure if you are <strong>safe</strong>... because <strong>they</strong> are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/04472b1db3571bc99ea1f190167fcae5.avif?t=1764529065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras_big/04472b1db3571bc99ea1f190167fcae5.avif?t=1764529065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714300?t=1764529065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/34f7d318c2caddcf979f8b4ceae3c2741dc7b977/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764529065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/4aaa5fc838c972fece3c9651175ccfce4d384ace/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764529065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/4aaa5fc838c972fece3c9651175ccfce4d384ace/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764529065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains a lot of blood and gore in a psx style"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this indie horror game, a small innocent vacation turns into a living nightmare as a brewing blizzard approaches the mountain. Explore the seemingly normal cabins, abandoned mines, caves and more as you avoid and fight moss creatures that came straight from the Skull lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunted by undead monsters and mutants  all made from a strange material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this FPS horror game with a PSX style, you can make your own choices that changes the story of the game. Each decision you make will affect the outcome of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/0553dd75d465e3edbc51b1bb07ef2e14.avif?t=1764529065\" data-big-src=https://shared.a